  "description": "The might of Metrolink takes a turn out of sprawling Los Angeles for an east-west express in Train Sim World®. Dash between highways and city blocks in bullet-esque fashion, soaking in the sun and soaring to the industry-laden outskirts of the San Gabriel Mountains along the San Bernardino Line.\n\nOpen the throttle on Metrolink's regional passenger service with 2 icons of Californian rail. The striking MP36, often dubbed the Baby Bullet, works in tandem with the modern F125 “Spirit” on the daily duties out of LA’s Union Station. Facing East, diesel equipment duty takes passengers on a sunny trip to San Bernardino. Run back in the cab of Rotem, with mixed bi-level formations in-between, offering a different perspective for the returning rush towards LA."
